---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: validate caller is Legion operator
    q_check_caller --> q_check_token: validate token address
    q_check_token --> q_get_balance: balance = token.balanceOf(address(this))
    q_get_balance --> q_transfer: token.transfer(recipient, balance)
    q_transfer --> [*]: emit EmergencyWithdraw event

    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: only Legion operators can trigger emergency withdrawal
        INV-002: emergency function bypasses normal phase restrictions
        INV-003: can withdraw any ERC20 token held by contract
    end note
